sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Foreman as Site Foreman
    participant App as React Native App
    participant Mono as Hardware Monotonic Clock
    participant Crypto as Crypto Engine
    participant DB as SQLCipher Encrypted DB

    Foreman->>App: Tap "Submit Attendance Checklist"
    App->>Mono: Query SystemClock.elapsedRealtime()
    Mono-->>App: Return M_event (ms)
    App->>App: Compute T_event = T_anchor + (M_event - M_anchor)
    
    loop For Each Worker in Crew
        App->>Crypto: Generate HMAC_SHA256(Key, Record + PreviousHash + M_event)
        Crypto-->>App: Return Hash_N
        App->>DB: INSERT INTO attendance_logs (Payload, Hash_N)
    end
    
    App-->>Foreman: Display "Attendance Saved Offline (Cryptographically Sealed)"
